Package: folio-graze
Version: 0.1.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: 8000
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libgtk-3-0, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 (>= 2.40), libjavascriptcoregtk-4.1-0, libcairo2, libglib2.0-0
Recommends: xdg-utils
Maintainer: Ron Shillings <ron.shillings@gmail.com>
Description: simple, private web browser
 Folio Graze is a small web browser on the system's WebKitGTK engine: tabs,
 an address bar that goes to an address or searches, back, forward, reload,
 zoom, find in page and print. Private by default: only encrypted pages
 (plain http:// is upgraded, and a site without encryption says so),
 third-party cookies blocked, tracking prevention on, private windows that
 keep nothing. No account, no sync, nothing sent anywhere but the sites you
 visit.
